    {
      "kind": "chapter",
      "level": 3,
      "text": "Pick a theme that fits your document"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narration",
      "text": "Every markoto document carries its own theme: fonts, colours, page margins, tables, the cover page. The same theme drives the preview and the PDF, so what you see on the right is what you send.",
      "file": "01.webp",
      "cursor": {
        "x": 640,
        "y": 26
      },
      "path": "/d/XdWK8KbsWk"
    },
    {
      "kind": "chapter",
      "level": 3,
      "text": "Open the theme panel"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narration",
      "text": "New documents use the markoto theme: Fraunces headings, Inter body text, warm paper and vermillion accents. To try other looks, open the theme panel.",
      "file": "02.webp",
      "cursor": {
        "x": 640,
        "y": 26
      },
      "path": "/d/XdWK8KbsWk"
    },
    {
      "kind": "approach",
      "file": "03.webp",
      "caption": "Click the Theme tab in the right sidebar",
      "cursor": {
        "x": 1260,
        "y": 98
      },
      "path": "/d/XdWK8KbsWk",
      "annotations": [
        {
          "label": "theme tab",
