    },
    {
      "kind": "chapter",
      "level": 3,
      "text": "Try a different preset"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narration",
      "text": "Each preset is a complete theme. Click a card to apply it; the preview updates right away, and your text stays exactly as it is.",
